{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"27":{"eng-name":"Drinks (Kitab Al-Ashribah)","ara-name":"كتاب الأشربة"}},"section_detail":{"27":{"hadithnumber_first":3669,"hadithnumber_last":3735,"arabicnumber_first":3669,"arabicnumber_last":3735}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3707,"arabicnumber":3707,"text":"Rapporté par Aïsha, la mère des croyants رضي الله عنها : « On faisait tremper des raisins secs pour le Messager d’Allah ﷺ, puis on y ajoutait des dattes sèches, ou bien on faisait tremper des dattes sèches puis on y ajoutait des raisins secs. »","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Daif Isnaad"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Daif Isnaad"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":27,"hadith":39},"chapter":{"id":8,"ara-name":"باب فِي الْخَلِيطَيْنِ","eng-name":"Mixing two items","isFirstHadith":false}}]}